    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点3: 卷积的代数性质(LTIS系统下可用)",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            586,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、交换律",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            273,
            153
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) = f _ {2} (t) * f _ {1} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            384,
            162,
            608,
            179
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、结合律与系统结构",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            185,
            363,
            200
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n[ f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) ] * f _ {3} (t) = f _ {1} (t) * [ f _ {2} (t) * f _ {3} (t) ]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            317,
            207,
            678,
            226
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "结合律用于系统分析，相当于串联系统的冲激响应，等于组成串联系统的各子系统冲激响应的卷积，如图所示。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            231,
            808,
            271
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
