            742,
            346
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "串联系统的 $h(t)=h_{1}(t)*h_{2}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            364,
            359,
            591,
            376
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、分配律与系统结构",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            404,
            363,
            421
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {1} (t) * \\left[ f _ {2} (t) + f _ {3} (t) \\right] = f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) + f _ {1} (t) * f _ {3} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            290,
            429,
            704,
            447
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "分配律用于系统分析，相当于并联系统的冲激响应，等于组成并联系统的各子系统冲激响应之和，如图所示。",
