        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、基于表达式法的卷积正向求解",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            453,
            153
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例36：设 $f_{1}(t) = 3e^{-2t}u(t)$ ， $f_{2}(t) = 2u(t)$ ，求卷积积分 $f_{1}(t)*f_{2}(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
