    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点5：卷积求解：图解法——借助于信号相乘运算",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            668,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、原理：两个信号的相乘",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            400,
            153
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、步骤",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            162,
            255,
            176
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)更换自变量",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            186,
            305,
            203
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {1} (t) \\rightarrow f _ {1} (\\tau), f _ {2} (t) \\rightarrow f _ {2} (\\tau)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            384,
            211,
            608,
            228
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)反转移位",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            233,
            289,
            249
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {2} (\\tau) \\stackrel {\\text {反转}} {\\longrightarrow} f _ {2} (- \\tau) \\stackrel {\\text {移项}} {\\longrightarrow} f _ {2} (t - \\tau)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            378,
            258,
            616,
            283
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)相乘，只关注时域有相交的情况",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            289,
            468,
            305
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {1} (\\tau) \\cdot f _ {2} (t - \\tau)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            433,
            313,
            561,
            330
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4)每种相交情况下的积分",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            334,
            396,
            351
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) \\cdot f _ {2} (t - \\tau) d \\tau\n$$",
